{"parents": [{"link": "../../", "title": "API Reference"}, {"link": "../", "title": "auth0_api_python"}], "prev": {"link": "../errors/", "title": "auth0_api_python.errors"}, "next": {"link": "../token_utils/", "title": "auth0_api_python.token_utils"}, "title": "auth0_api_python.token_store", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"module-auth0_api_python.token_store\">\n<span id=\"auth0-api-python-token-store\"></span><h1>auth0_api_python.token_store<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-auth0_api_python.token_store\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>Token storage for SDK-minted tokens (OBO, M2M, Token Vault), distinct from CacheAdapter.</p>\n<section id=\"classes\">\n<h2>Classes<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#classes\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenSet\" title=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenSet\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TokenSet</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>A minted access token and its absolute expiration, as stored by a TokenStore.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.VerifiedToken\" title=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.VerifiedToken\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">VerifiedToken</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Access token with verified claims from verify_access_token, trusted to build the cache key.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.AbstractTokenStore\" title=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.AbstractTokenStore\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AbstractTokenStore</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Base class for external token stores with built-in JWE encrypt and decrypt helpers.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenIndexMember\" title=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenIndexMember\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TokenIndexMember</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>One cached token listed in an index, with the scopes it was granted and when it expires.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.IndexedTokenStore\" title=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.IndexedTokenStore\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">IndexedTokenStore</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Token store variant that maintains a scope index with atomic member writes to avoid concurrent-add races.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-contents\">\n<h2>Module Contents<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-contents\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenSet\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_api_python.token_store.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">TokenSet</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenSet\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">_TokenSetRequired</span></code></p>\n<p>A minted access token and its absolute expiration, as stored by a TokenStore.</p>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenSet.granted_scopes\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">granted_scopes</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">str</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenSet.granted_scopes\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenSet.token_type\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">token_type</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">str</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenSet.token_type\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.VerifiedToken\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_api_python.token_store.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">VerifiedToken</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.VerifiedToken\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Access token with verified claims from verify_access_token, trusted to build the cache key.</p>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.VerifiedToken.access_token\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">access_token</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">str</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.VerifiedToken.access_token\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.VerifiedToken.claims\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">claims</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">collections.abc.Mapping</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.VerifiedToken.claims\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.AbstractTokenStore\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_api_python.token_store.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">AbstractTokenStore</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">*</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">secret</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.AbstractTokenStore\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">abc.ABC</span></code></p>\n<p>Base class for external token stores with built-in JWE encrypt and decrypt helpers.</p>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.AbstractTokenStore.get\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenSet\" title=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenSet\"><span class=\"pre\">TokenSet</span></a><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.AbstractTokenStore.get\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Async<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p></p></dd>\n</dl>\n<p>Return the stored token or None if absent.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.AbstractTokenStore.set\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">set</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">value</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenSet\" title=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenSet\"><span class=\"pre\">TokenSet</span></a></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.AbstractTokenStore.set\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Async<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p></p></dd>\n</dl>\n<p>Store a token under key.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.AbstractTokenStore.delete\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">delete</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.AbstractTokenStore.delete\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Async<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p></p></dd>\n</dl>\n<p>Delete a stored token by key.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.AbstractTokenStore.encrypt\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">encrypt</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">value</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenSet\" title=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenSet\"><span class=\"pre\">TokenSet</span></a></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.AbstractTokenStore.encrypt\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Encrypt a TokenSet to a JWE string, keyed to this specific cache entry.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.AbstractTokenStore.decrypt\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">decrypt</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">data</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenSet\" title=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenSet\"><span class=\"pre\">TokenSet</span></a></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.AbstractTokenStore.decrypt\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Decrypt a JWE string back to a TokenSet.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenIndexMember\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_api_python.token_store.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">TokenIndexMember</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenIndexMember\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TypedDict</span></code></p>\n<p>One cached token listed in an index, with the scopes it was granted and when it expires.</p>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenIndexMember.token_key\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">token_key</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">str</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenIndexMember.token_key\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenIndexMember.granted_scopes\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">granted_scopes</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">str</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenIndexMember.granted_scopes\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenIndexMember.expires_at\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">expires_at</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">int</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenIndexMember.expires_at\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.IndexedTokenStore\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_api_python.token_store.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">IndexedTokenStore</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">*</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">secret</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.IndexedTokenStore\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.AbstractTokenStore\" title=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.AbstractTokenStore\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AbstractTokenStore</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Token store variant that maintains a scope index with atomic member writes to avoid concurrent-add races.</p>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.IndexedTokenStore.add_index_member\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">add_index_member</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">index_key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">member</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenIndexMember\" title=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.TokenIndexMember\"><span class=\"pre\">TokenIndexMember</span></a></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.token_store.IndexedTokenStore.add_index_member\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Async<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p></p></dd>\n</dl>\n<p>Atomically add member to the index, replacing any member with the same token_key.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.token_store.IndexedTokenStore.list_index_members\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">abstract</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">list_index_members</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">index_key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">list</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"